dels. ; A dataset used for training and evaluating car detection models. ; A dataset used for training and evaluating car detection models.\n', "Name:FASTER R-CNN\nDescription:A deep learning-based object detection method, an evolution of R-CNN, used for car detection. ; A deep learning method for object detection, used in this study for car detection, which builds upon R-CNN and Fast R-CNN by introducing a Region Proposal Network (RPN). ; A deep learning model used for object detection, built upon R-CNN, and central to the paper's focus on car detection. ; A deep learning-based object detection algorithm used for car detection, employing a Region Proposal Network (RPN) and a classification network. ; The deep learning framework used for car detection, employing CNN architectures like VGG16 and AlexNet, and incorporating a Region Proposal Network (RPN). ; A deep learning-based object detection framework used for car detection. ; A deep learning method for object detection, used in the study for car detection. ; The deep learning method used for car detection, and its performance is evaluated with different configurations, including context windows, anchor box selection schemes, and different CNN architectures.\n"]split_entities: text_tokens=2579, instructions_tokens=500, budget_for_entities=6921, number_of_entities=41, avg_entity_tokens=68, max_entities=101, num_groups=1, entities_per_group=[41]
